	<#f4cf72>CAMMY — SSF2X</>
	<#aab8c7>Moves & Controls</>

<#72c8eb>BUTTONS</>
Light Punch		^X
Medium Punch		^Y
Heavy Punch		^Z
Light Kick		^A
Medium Kick		^B
Heavy Kick		^C
<#aab8c7>Directions are relative to your opponent.</>
<#aab8c7>A plus sign means simultaneous input.</>

<#72c8eb>THROWS</>
Hooligan Suplex		[_F/_B]_+[^Y/^Z]
Frankensteiner		[_F/_B]_+[^B/^C]
<#aab8c7>Close to a grounded opponent.</>
Flying Neck Hunt		[_F/_B]_+[^Y/^Z]
Air Frankensteiner		[_F/_B]_+[^B/^C]
<#aab8c7>Air throws: both fighters must be airborne.</>
<#aab8c7>Release Up before attempting an air throw.</>

<#72c8eb>EX MOVES — HOW TO USE</>
<#aab8c7>EX moves are powered-up specials in some fighting styles.</>
<#aab8c7>This character has no EX special-move versions.</>
<#aab8c7>Use one Punch or Kick for the normal strength variants.</>
<#aab8c7>A full meter enables Spin Drive Smasher, listed below.</>

<#72c8eb>SPECIAL MOVES</>
Spiral Arrow		_D_DF_F_+[^A/^B/^C]
Cannon Spike		_F_D_DF_+[^A/^B/^C]
Axle Spin Knuckle		_B_DB_F_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
Hooligan Combination		_DB_D_DF_F_UF_+[^X/^Y/^Z]
<#aab8c7>Use a light, medium or heavy button to vary</>
<#aab8c7>the move's version.</>

<#72c8eb>HOOLIGAN FOLLOW-UPS</>
Fatal Leg Twister		[_F/_B]_+[^A/^B/^C]
<#aab8c7>During Hooligan, near a grounded opponent's head.</>
Cross Scissor Pressure		[_F/_B]_+[^A/^B/^C]
<#aab8c7>During Hooligan, near the opponent's midsection.</>
<#aab8c7>Can also catch an airborne opponent.</>
Cancel		[^A/^B/^C]
<#aab8c7>During Hooligan, high enough and away from a grab.</>
Razor Edge Slicer		No additional input
<#aab8c7>Let Hooligan reach the ground without a follow-up.</>

<#72c8eb>SUPER — FULL METER</>
Spin Drive Smasher		_D_DF_F_D_DF_+[^A/^B/^C]
<#aab8c7>Finish the directional input on Down-Forward.</>
Easy Super		^X_+^A
<#aab8c7>Both Super inputs require a full meter.</>
<#aab8c7>Perform the Super while grounded.</>
